696034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Checkpoints save your progress but slow you down</i><br><br></li><li>777 coins to find... collect them all for a secret ending.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/bb9aa72e8674188c1483073a8da4341b.poster.avif?t=1588696034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/bb9aa72e8674188c1483073a8da4341b.webm?t=1588696034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/bb9aa72e8674188c1483073a8da4341b.mp4?t=1588696034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Put your platforming skills to the test, for fun and profit</i><br><br></li><li>5 hidden gems to find for a another secret ending!<br></li><li>Full soundtrack by Pete Gresser (Reimagine: The Game)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/1a47361e2a0eb48e2cef892ca1cd4336.webp?t=1588696034\" /></div>",
